        {
          "id": "codex-jiegou_yuandian-0248",
          "alias": "仲夏",
          "prompt": "year 2025, 2::yao liao wang::, 1.5::xilmo:: ,1.1::fkey::, meinoss ,dikko ,1.1::some1else45 ::, akipeko, chuck_(harfmoondark)\n, miv4t，，,::,0.5::wlop::,-2::artist collaboration::,,0.7::solipsist,::\n1.1::impasto,painterly::,,year 2025, ,year 2024，\n2girls, school uniforms, night scene, rice paddy, koi fish, flashlights, sailor collar, scenery, mysterious atmosphere\nDescription: A mysterious and atmospheric illustration of two young women in school uniforms standing in a dark rice paddy at night. One girl kneels, shining a flashlight near a bucket, while the other stands behind her, directing her flashlight forward. Above them hovers a glowing red koi fish, adding a surreal touch to the scene. The background features a body of water, distant lights on the opposite shore, and a starless night sky, creating an eerie yet captivating mood. Their uniforms include blue sailor collars, pleated skirts, and black-framed glasses, grounding the fantastical elements in a familiar school setting..\n, artist:dikko, artist:tianliang duohe fangdongye,,, fkey, betabeet，,\n, artist:wlop, artist:xilmo,\nnsfw，impasto, realistic, chiaroscuro, photorealistic,, newest,,\nmasterpiece,,\n,, beautiful colors,, detailed background,,, ray tracing,\nrating:general,rating:general, best quality, very aesthetic, absurdres,location, no ,text,-1::sketch::,-1::line art::, -0.5::monochrome::,-1::simple::,-1::broing::",
